            "Yes, under the traditional 'natural accumulation' rule, because landowners owe no common law duty to remove naturally falling snow or ice from outdoor surfaces.",
            "Yes, because the pedestrian assumed the risk by voluntarily attempting to descend outdoor concrete stairs during active freezing rain.",
